---
import PublicImage from '../components/PublicImage.astro';
import PageJumpLinks from '../components/PageJumpLinks.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HeroSection from '../components/HeroSection.astro';
import BookingButton from '../components/BookingButton.astro';
import FAQSection from '../components/FAQSection.astro';
import ServiceArticles from '../components/ServiceArticles.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Herbal Therapy"
  description="Evidence-based herbal therapy in Halifax. Dr. Colin MacLeod uses scientifically-supported botanical therapies to treat a wide range of health conditions naturally."
  focusKeyword="herbal therapy Halifax"
>
  <HeroSection
    title="Herbal Therapy"
    compact
  >
    <p>Plants have been used as remedies for thousands of years. Today, modern research helps clarify the potential benefits, limitations and safety considerations of botanical products.</p>
    <p class="text-white/80">Dr. Colin MacLeod, ND combines traditional herbal knowledge with current scientific research to create personalized botanical protocols.</p>
    <div slot="media" class="mx-auto aspect-[16/9] w-full max-w-lg overflow-hidden rounded-2xl lg:max-w-none">
      <PublicImage src="/images/reference/services/herbal-therapy.webp" alt="Herbal therapy preparations"   class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="eager" />
    </div>
  </HeroSection>

  <PageJumpLinks items={[{"id": "evidence-based-botanical-therapy", "title": "Approach"}, {"id": "common-applications", "title": "Applications"}, {"id": "quality--safety", "title": "Quality & safety"}]} />

  <!-- Our Approach Section -->
  <section id="evidence-based-botanical-therapy" class="care-section">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <div class="text-left mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-medium text-emerald-950 mb-4">Evidence-Based Botanical Therapy</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Bridging traditional wisdom with modern science
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Many of today's pharmaceutical drugs are derived from plants. Aspirin comes from white willow bark, the cancer drug Taxol from Pacific yew and morphine from the opium poppy. Plants contain complex combinations of active compounds that can be remarkably effective for treating disease.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            As a Naturopathic Doctor with extensive training in botanical therapy, I select herbs based on both traditional use and current research. This ensures you receive treatments that are not only time-tested but also supported by scientific evidence.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Herbal products may be considered alongside conventional treatments when evidence, safety and the individual's circumstances support their use.
          </p>
        </div>
        <dl class="divide-y divide-emerald-200 border-y border-emerald-200">
          <div class="py-4"><dt class="mb-1 font-semibold text-emerald-950">Research-Backed</dt><dd class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Herbs selected based on clinical evidence</dd></div>
          <div class="py-4"><dt class="mb-1 font-semibold text-emerald-950">Quality Sourced</dt><dd class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Professional-grade botanical products</dd></div>
          <div class="py-4"><dt class="mb-1 font-semibold text-emerald-950">Personalized</dt><dd class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Formulas tailored to your needs</dd></div>
          <div class="py-4"><dt class="mb-1 font-semibold text-emerald-950">Safe Integration</dt><dd class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Checked for drug interactions</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Common Applications Section -->
  <section id="common-applications" class="care-section">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <div class="text-left mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-medium text-emerald-950 mb-4">Common Applications</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Herbal therapy can be helpful for a wide range of health concerns
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 gap-y-5">
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Stress & Anxiety</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Adaptogenic herbs like rhodiola, ashwagandha and holy basil support the body's stress response and promote calm.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Digestive Health</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Bitter herbs, carminatives and demulcents can address bloating, reflux, IBS symptoms and other GI concerns.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Sleep Support</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Gentle sedative herbs like valerian, passionflower and hops can improve sleep quality without morning grogginess.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Immune Support</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Immune-modulating herbs help prevent illness and support recovery from infections.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Hormone Balance</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Herbs like chaste tree, black cohosh and maca can support hormonal health in both women and men.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Liver & Detoxification</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Milk thistle, dandelion and other hepatoprotective herbs support healthy liver function.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Pain & Inflammation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Anti-inflammatory herbs like turmeric, boswellia and devil's claw can help manage chronic pain conditions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Cardiovascular Health</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Herbs like hawthorn, garlic and olive leaf support healthy blood pressure and circulation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-emerald-200 pt-5 pb-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-emerald-950 mb-3">Energy & Vitality</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Tonic herbs can help restore energy levels and combat fatigue without stimulant side effects.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quality & Safety Section -->
  <section id="quality--safety" class="care-section">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="care-item text-slate-600">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium mb-6 text-emerald-950">Quality & Safety</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold mb-1 text-emerald-950">Professional-Grade Products</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">We use only professional-quality botanical products that are tested for purity, potency and safety.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold mb-1 text-emerald-950">Drug Interaction Screening</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">All herbal recommendations are checked against your current medications to ensure safe use.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold mb-1 text-emerald-950">Proper Dosing</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Herbs are dosed based on research and clinical experience to ensure effectiveness and safety.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold mb-1 text-emerald-950">Ongoing Monitoring</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">We track your response to treatment and adjust protocols as needed for optimal results.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-medium text-emerald-950 mb-6">Why Professional Guidance Matters</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            While herbal products are widely available, effective botanical therapy requires proper training. Naturopathic Doctors complete extensive coursework in pharmacognosy (the study of medicinal plants) and botanical therapy as part of their four-year professional naturopathic program.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Self-treating with herbs can lead to ineffective treatment, adverse effects or dangerous interactions with medications. Professional guidance ensures you receive the right herbs, in the right form, at the right dose.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4">
            <p class="text-sm text-amber-800">
              <strong>Important:</strong> Always inform your healthcare providers about any herbal products you're taking, as some herbs can interact with medications or affect certain medical conditions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FAQSection bg="white" sectionClass="bg-white pt-20 lg:pt-24 pb-12 lg:pb-16" items={[
        { question: "What are the risks of herbal products?", answer: "<p>Herbal products can cause adverse effects, interact with medications, affect pregnancy or health conditions and vary in quality or concentration. Suitability depends on the specific product, dose and individual circumstances; “natural” does not mean risk-free.</p>" },
        { question: "Can I take herbs with my medications?", answer: "<p>Many herbs can be safely combined with medications, but some combinations should be avoided. During your consultation, we review all medications and supplements you're taking and check for potential interactions before recommending any botanical therapies.</p>" },
        { question: "How long does herbal treatment take to work?", answer: "<p>This varies depending on the condition and the herbs used. Some effects, like digestive relief from carminative herbs, can be noticed quickly. Other conditions, like hormone balancing or building stress resilience, may take several weeks to months to show full benefit. We'll discuss realistic expectations for your specific situation.</p>" },
        { question: "What forms do herbal products come in?", answer: "<p>Herbal products are available in many forms including tinctures (liquid extracts), capsules, tablets, teas and topical preparations. The form recommended depends on the herb, the health concern and your personal preferences. We'll work together to find what works best for you.</p>" },
      ]} />

  <ServiceArticles
    slugs={["herbal-therapy-history-and-uses", "adaptogens-for-stress-ashwagandha-rhodiola-and-beyond", "immune-support-natural-approaches"]}
    subtitle="Explore our articles on herbal therapy and natural health."
    bg="emerald"
  />

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="care-closing">
    <div class="section-shell text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-medium text-white mb-6">Interested in Herbal Therapy?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Book a consultation to discuss how botanical therapies can support your health goals as part of a comprehensive treatment plan.
      </p>
      <BookingButton source="herbal-therapy-cta" placement="closing" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Schema Structured Data -->
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Herbal Therapy",
      "serviceType": "Botanical Therapy",
      "description": "Evidence-based herbal therapy using scientifically-supported botanical therapies to treat a wide range of health conditions naturally.",
      "provider": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Dr. Colin MacLeod",
        "jobTitle": "Naturopathic Doctor"
      },
      "areaServed": {
        "@type": "City",
        "name": "Halifax",
        "containedInPlace": {
          "@type": "State",
          "name": "Nova Scotia"
        }
      },
      "availableChannel": {
        "@type": "ServiceChannel",
        "serviceUrl": "https://drcolinmacleod.com/herbal-therapy/",
        "serviceLocation": {
          "@type": "Place",
          "name": "Optimal Wellbeing Clinic",
          "address": {
            "@type": "PostalAddress",
            "streetAddress": "1378 Bedford Highway, Unit 1",
            "addressLocality": "Bedford",
            "addressRegion": "Nova Scotia",
            "postalCode": "B4A 1E2",
            "addressCountry": "CA"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
